## 💡 TIPS

- **Every time you want to use the system**, you need to start all 3 terminals again
- **Don't close the terminals** while using the system — it will stop working
- The **first time** you run the AI Backend, it downloads the BERT model (~440MB). This is normal and only happens once.
- If something breaks, **restart all 3 terminals** — that fixes most problems

